---
import PortfolioLayout from "@/layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro";
---

<PortfolioLayout title="作品查看路径" description="按项目类型快速浏览角色设计、AIGC 图片生产、原创 IP 与汽车车衣视觉案例。">
	<header class="page-hero site-shell"><div class="page-hero__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURATED VIEW</p><h1 class="page-title">先看画面，<br />再看能不能交付。</h1></div><p class="page-summary">整理一条最短作品阅读路径：先用视觉建立判断，再进入项目细节、源文件和可编辑交接。</p></div></header>
	<section class="section"><div class="site-shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">START HERE</p><h2 class="section-title">先看这四组。</h2></div><p class="section-heading__note">用最少页面快速覆盖角色、图片、车衣和原创 IP 四种能力。</p></div><div class="resume-capabilities">
		<div><span>01</span><h3>角色与世界</h3><p>先看角色轮廓、服装、道具和世界规则是否稳定。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/ajgc-designer/">打开岗位定向总览 <span>↗</span></a></div>
		<div><span>02</span><h3>AIGC 图片</h3><p>查看候选生成、人工筛选、精修和整组一致性。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/trueyou-studio/">打开图片生产案例 <span>↗</span></a></div>
		<div><span>03</span><h3>汽车车衣</h3><p>查看痛车、国潮、赛博和运动方向的多场景视觉。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/ai-automotive-visual/">打开车衣视觉案例 <span>↗</span></a></div>
		<div><span>04</span><h3>原创 IP</h3><p>查看角色如何延展到商品、包装和陈列表达。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/original-ip-studio/">打开原创 IP 总览 <span>↗</span></a></div>
	</div></div></section>
	<section class="section"><div class="site-shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">DETAILS</p><h2 class="section-title">再看生产证据。</h2></div><p class="section-heading__note">从视觉结果进入做法和交付，不需要翻完整站点。</p></div><div class="resume-capabilities">
		<div><span>01</span><h3>初稿与筛选</h3><p>对照候选、拒绝原因和最终统一结果。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/aigc-draft-library/">查看初稿筛选库 <span>↗</span></a></div>
		<div><span>02</span><h3>PS / AI 后期</h3><p>查看精修、结构修正、透明边缘和 QA。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/cosplay-retouch/">查看精修对比 <span>↗</span></a></div>
		<div><span>03</span><h3>文件交接</h3><p>查看 PSD、SVG、版本和生产边界。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/production-file-handoff/">查看交接案例 <span>↗</span></a></div>
		<div><span>04</span><h3>源文件索引</h3><p>需要核对时直接进入角色、包装和车衣源文件。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/source-file-index/">打开源文件索引 <span>↗</span></a></div>
	</div></div></section>
	<section class="dark-section"><div class="site-shell dark-section__grid"><div class="dark-section__copy"><p class="eyebrow">SOURCE FILES</p><h2 class="section-title">进入可编辑文件。</h2><p>可从源文件索引打开原创角色、包装、PSD、SVG 与汽车车衣文件。文件用于核对结构和编辑能力，实际生产参数仍需结合供应商模板确认。</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/source-file-index/">查看并下载源文件 <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="research-list"><div class="research-item"><span>01</span><div><strong>角色</strong><p>设定、提示词、四视图与世界规则</p></div></div><div class="research-item"><span>02</span><div><strong>商品</strong><p>包装刀模、品牌图形与分层 PSD</p></div></div><div class="research-item"><span>03</span><div><strong>车衣</strong><p>车身图形 SVG、效果图 PSD 与项目说明</p></div></div></div></div></section>
</PortfolioLayout>
